'''Silver Elderwood Blade '''is a [[Unique Weapons|unique]] knife that was awarded to the player that finished '''2nd''' in the [[Halloween Event 2022]] Leaderboard.

==Appearance==
It has a jagged tanto-shaped blade that is black with a cracked texture over it. The edge of the blade is a shiny silver, and streaks of silver can be seen along the spine. The guard and handle, resembling a tree branch, are black with thin silver steaks and are connected together. Part of the guard curls onto the spine of the blade, and the other part droops in front of the handle.

==Trivia==
*Other variants of this include [[Gold Elderwood Blade]], [[Bronze Elderwood Blade]], and [[Blue Elderwood Blade]].
*This item is a silver reskin of the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife [[Elderwood Blade]].
*Like all other [[Unique Weapons|unique weapons]] (excluding [[Corrupt]]), this item is [[Trading|untradable]].
*When leaderboard rewards released on November 10th, 2022, they initially appeared as [[Godly Weapons|godlies]] when players claimed them and in their inventory. The issue was fixed on December 23rd, 2022.
*The sole owner of this knife is [https://www.roblox.com/users/93704180/profile MorallyLow].

